      "id": "claim_76f8bca6877247efb2a96ed2978ff136",
      "statement": "detectOutOfRangeAlerts is pure (no I/O, no store access) and emits at most one alert per position, and only when the previous snapshot records the position in range (previous[id] === true) while the current snapshot records it out of range — state alone never alerts.",
