    {
      "id": "claim_886aa8855d9943a4a4d8abd47c2c77bd",
      "statement": "The widget-background-sync task is the feature's only production call site: after syncWidgets completes and the wallet checks pass, it gates on useSettingsStore.getState().alertsEnabled (persisted Zustand setting, default false, read headlessly without React), loads the portfolio via createPositionPipeline().loadPortfolio, maps each position to { id, inRange: p.vm.inRange }, then reads previous via getRangeState, stores nextState with setRangeState, and only then awaits sendOutOfRangeNotifications.",
