    {
      "id": "claim_ed668cd58ce248f6b2805c48e769cd2c",
      "statement": "The task captures getStoredWalletSnapshot() at start and defines walletIsCurrent() as an address-AND-revision comparison against a fresh read; it re-checks after syncWidgets (with the no-address check, returning NoData if the wallet vanished) and again after the awaited loadPortfolio, so a wallet switch, disconnect, or same-address reconnect in flight aborts before any state is read, recorded, or alerted — the task never alerts the wrong wallet or a stale session.",
